<title>KUWAIT: Kuwait private deposits up in Dec month/month.</title>
<headline>Kuwait private deposits up in Dec month/month.</headline>
<dateline>KUWAIT 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Private sector deposits with banks in Kuwait rose to 6.981 billion dinars at the end of December from 6.934 billion at the end of November, Central Bank figures showed.</p>
<p>The deposits stood at 7.063 billion in December 1995.</p>
<p>			   Data in million dinars</p>
<p>				  Dec '96    Nov '96    Dec '95</p>
<p>Dinar deposits		5,724.1    5,641.3    5,755.3</p>
<p>Foreign currency deposits 1,256.5    1,292.5    1,307.9</p>
<p>($1 = 0.303 dinar)</p>
</text>
